<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Balloon Pop! — Level 1</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Press+Start+2P&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --sky1:#7ec8f7; --sky2:#cdeaff; --grass1:#69c94e; --grass2:#4fae3a;
    --wood1:#8a5a2b; --wood2:#6b421d; --ink:#20242c; --paper:#fff8e7;
    --accent:#ff5a5a; --gold:#ffd23f;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html,body{height:100%;}
  body{
    font-family:'Press Start 2P', monospace;
    background:#0e1420;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    overflow:hidden; user-select:none;
  }
  #wrap{
    position:relative;
    width:min(96vw, 1000px);
    aspect-ratio:16/9;
    border:6px solid #2b2f38;
    border-radius:10px;
    overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.55), inset 0 0 0 2px #454b57;
    background:linear-gradient(#7ec8f7,#cdeaff);
  }
  canvas{position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; display:block; cursor:crosshair;}
  .overlay{
    position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:22px;
    background:rgba(10,16,28,.72); backdrop-filter:blur(2px);
    color:var(--paper); text-align:center; padding:20px; z-index:5;
  }
  .overlay.hidden{display:none;}
  h1{
    font-size:clamp(20px,4.4vw,44px); color:var(--gold);
    text-shadow:3px 3px 0 #b8860b, 6px 6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    letter-spacing:2px;
  }
  h2{font-size:clamp(16px,3vw,30px); color:#fff; text-shadow:2px 2px 0 #000;}
  p{font-size:clamp(8px,1.5vw,13px); line-height:1.9; color:#e8ecf4; max-width:640px;}
  .btn{
    font-family:inherit; font-size:clamp(11px,2vw,18px);
    color:#3a2405; background:linear-gradient(#ffd23f,#ffb020);
    border:0; border-bottom:6px solid #b8791a; border-radius:8px;
    padding:16px 30px; cursor:pointer; letter-spacing:1px;
    box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    transition:transform .06s, filter .12s;
  }
  .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.06);}
  .btn:active{transform:translateY(4px); border-bottom-width:2px;}
  .score-big{font-size:clamp(18px,3.4vw,34px); color:var(--gold); text-shadow:2px 2px 0 #000;}
  .tag{font-size:clamp(8px,1.4vw,12px); color:#9fb0c8;}
  .win h1{color:#7dff9b; text-shadow:3px 3px 0 #1f7a3a, 6px 6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.35);}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="wrap">
  <canvas id="game"></canvas>

  <div id="start" class="overlay">
    <h1>BALLOON POP!</h1>
    <p>Level 1 &mdash; Pop <b>15</b> balloons.<br>
       Aim with the mouse &bull; hold to draw &bull; release to fire.<br>
       You have <b>10</b> arrows. Miss too many and it&rsquo;s over!</p>
    <button id="startBtn" class="btn">START</button>
    <p class="tag">Tip: full draw = max power. Balloons drift &amp; bob.</p>
  </div>

  <div id="over" class="overlay hidden">
    <h1>OUT OF ARROWS</h1>
    <p class="score-big">SCORE <span id="overScore">0</span></p>
    <p id="overMsg"></p>
    <button id="retryBtn" class="btn">TRY AGAIN</button>
  </div>

  <div id="win" class="overlay win hidden">
    <h1>LEVEL CLEAR!</h1>
    <p class="score-big">SCORE <span id="winScore">0</span></p>
    <p>Every balloon popped. Nice shooting!</p>
    <button id="againBtn" class="btn">PLAY AGAIN</button>
  </div>
</div>

